<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>EmpathyIsAGreyArea on behaviorengineering.ai</title><link>https://behaviorengineering.ai/pr-preview/pr-15/tags/empathyisagreyarea/</link><description>Recent content in EmpathyIsAGreyArea on behaviorengineering.ai</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 23 Jun 2026 01:00:00 +1100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://behaviorengineering.ai/pr-preview/pr-15/tags/empathyisagreyarea/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>ℹ️ Why is sociopathy still a taboo?</title><link>https://behaviorengineering.ai/pr-preview/pr-15/human-condition/2026-06-23-sociopathy-duty-of-care/</link><pubDate>Tue, 23 Jun 2026 01:00:00 +1100</pubDate><guid>https://behaviorengineering.ai/pr-preview/pr-15/human-condition/2026-06-23-sociopathy-duty-of-care/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;We treat sociopathy as a movie villain rather than a biological reality. We binge fiction about serial killers and crack jokes about &amp;ldquo;psychos&amp;rdquo; because it is easier than admitting some people never grow a &amp;ldquo;good&amp;rdquo; switch to flip.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Silence leaves families and kids without clear guidance. Parents often rely on abstract moralizing instead of practical rules. Adults who recognize their own lack of internal regulation often hide it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When the &lt;strong&gt;guilt loop&lt;/strong&gt; never wires in, internal pressure builds without a release mechanism. This often leads to externalized harm. The taboo prevents the practical solutions needed to manage this behavior.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>🫂🧱 Empathy is a stack of feeling, perspective, and judgment, and systems can aim it</title><link>https://behaviorengineering.ai/pr-preview/pr-15/human-condition/2026-04-10-empathy-levels/</link><pubDate>Fri, 10 Apr 2026 01:00:00 +1100</pubDate><guid>https://behaviorengineering.ai/pr-preview/pr-15/human-condition/2026-04-10-empathy-levels/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="three-kinds-of-getting-it"&gt;Three kinds of “getting it”&lt;/h3&gt;
